  "text": "Board of Elections | Halifax County, NC\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account\n- Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nHow Do I...\nVisitors\nBusiness\nResidents\nHome\nGovernment\nBoards & Commissions\nBoard of Elections\nBoard of Elections\nThe Board of Elections makes sure our voices are heard by supporting the voting process in Halifax County. The Board of elections staff works year-round to conduct national, state, county, and municipal elections in addition to special referendums.\nDuties & Responsibilities\nThe duties of the Election office include:\nRegistering new voters\nProviding ballots and staffing for Halifax County's 19 precinct polling places\nKeeping voter registrations updated by removing deceased, felon, and voters that have moved from the county\nKeeping abreast of changes in election laws and regulations\nMaintaining campaign reports for candidates\nCurrent Election Documents\n2026 Filing Fee Chart\n2026 Candidate Filings\n2026 Board Meeting Dates\n2026 Election Schedule\n2026 Early Voting Plan\nElected Officials\nHalifax County Buffer Zones (PDF)\nHalifax County Polling Places (PDF)\nState Absentee Request Form (PDF)\nUOCAVA Notice-General Election 2026\nQuick Links\nNorth Carolina State Board of Elections\nNorth Carolina State Board of Elections Voter Tools\nView All Links\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nContact Us\nKristin Scott\nBoard of Elections Director\nEmail Kristin Scott\nBoard of Elections\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n10 N King Street\nHalifax\n,\nNC\n27839\n10 N King Street Halifax NC 27839\nDirections\nMailing Address\nP.O. Box 101\nHalifax\n,\nNC\n27839\nPhone:\n252-583-4391\nFax: 252-583-1068\nDirectory\nHalifax County Board of Elections Board Member Contact Information:\nByron Waters, Chair\nbyron.waters@verizon.net\nDaniel Duke\ndcduke18@gmail.com\nErvin Griffin\ngriffinervin3@gmail.com\nClarence Pender\nclarence_pender@yahoo.com\nJane Watson\njbeale@yahoo.com\nDocuments & Applications\nElection Results\nAbsentee Voting\nMilitary and Overseas Voting\nHow to Register\nVoter Lookup\nNC State Board of Elections Homepage\nRegistering As A Person in The Criminal Justice System\n10 Facts About NC's Photo ID Requirement\nHistorical Election Results Data NCSBE\nCandidate Filing-Soil and Water District\nVote Early In Person\nPublic Notices\nHalifax County Board of Commissioners\nAgendas & Minutes\nOnline Payments\nEmployment\nContact the County\nHistoric Courthouse\n10 North King Street\nHalifax, NC 27839\nMailing Address:\nP.O. Box 38\nHalifax, NC 27839\nQuick Links\nDepartment of Social Services\nTax Administration\nPublic Health System\nHalifax County Sheriff's Office\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus\u00ae\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
